Blue Lagoon: The Awakening is a drama, adventure,
romance film directed by Jake Newsome.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Two high school students become stranded on a tropical
island and must rely on each other for survival.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
